[
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Cumulative relative total shareholder return index",
        "bbox": [
            185,
            418,
            394,
            431
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Delving Deeper into Downturn M&A",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            36,
            13,
            553,
            42
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Acquirers generally see higher returns from deals made in a weak economy, a study by BCG finds",
        "bbox": [
            35,
            46,
            528,
            60
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "DEALMAKERS ARE BRACING FOR A DOWNTURN AGAINST THE BACKDROP OF SOFTENING INVESTOR SUPPORT",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            157,
            109,
            818,
            135
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Acquirers' cumulative abnormal returns (CARs) centered on the announcement date fell to an average of $-0.4\\%$ in 2018. This is the first time since 2012 that CARs were negative for acquirers of public targets.",
        "bbox": [
            157,
            140,
            809,
            159
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "chart",
        "img_path": "images/f30323e852f9f079be2c407647c2326301376259817e837243375e2d07da967d.jpg",
        "content": "",
        "chart_caption": [],
        "chart_footnote": [],
        "bbox": [
            48,
            162,
            847,
            323
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "EVEN IF A DOWNTURN OCCURS, DEALMAKERS SHOULD NOT BE DETERRED",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            157,
            354,
            801,
            371
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "In the medium term, weak-economy deals create more value for buyers than strong-economy deals. Two years after an acquisition, buyers' relative total shareholder return (RTSR) is more than 9 percentage points higher.",
        "bbox": [
            157,
            375,
            835,
            394
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/6a875102400213cc0fbc32c0fc5c8d74987df5640bb8b03abd0d49579bf6ef53.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [
            "Year 2"
        ],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            65,
            413,
            879,
            492
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "BOLDNESS PAYS OFF, AS DOWNTURN",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            120,
            508,
            409,
            524
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "In a weak economy, noncore deals (acquisitions outside the buyer's industry) create more value than core deals: 1-year RTSR is 3.9 percentage points higher",
        "bbox": [
            91,
            554,
            410,
            584
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1-YEAR RTSR (%)",
        "bbox": [
            538,
            519,
            675,
            526
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/e7cab1583f27574f527a09ac4530a15027c81a26dcf4f372c133ad01f06ac168.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [
            "Core segment acquisition",
            "Noncore segment acquisition"
        ],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            542,
            532,
            941,
            584
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "EXPERIENCE MATTERS, A",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            55,
            603,
            408,
            611
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "LOT, WHEN IT COMES TO CREATING VALUE FROM WEAK-ECONOMY DEALS",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            58,
            610,
            409,
            637
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "In a downturn, experienced buyers create significantly more value from M&A than occasional buyers: 2-year RTSR of 7.3% for experienced versus 1.4% for occasional",
        "bbox": [
            69,
            640,
            409,
            670
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2-YEAR RTSR (%)",
        "bbox": [
            539,
            614,
            676,
            621
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/7033a7c137c9a59b4476b22caba034bb5f17424ed4bea273e4d42f331d61c61f.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [
            "Experienced Occasional"
        ],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            543,
            626,
            919,
            675
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "TO MASTER M&A IN A DOWNTURN, BUYERS SHOULD FOLLOW A SET OF IMPERATIVES",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            35,
            717,
            640,
            734
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/4012ef5d99af405d1142695faee987ebec57d6cfef7ca819f533c5360ea92d03.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            354,
            742,
            552,
            788
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Be prepared",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            358,
            791,
            489,
            798
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Put in place an ongoing target-screening process that covers strategic priorities — it’s a no-regrets move",
        "bbox": [
            357,
            800,
            628,
            824
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/2b3628382afdef5c4748aa32eeb48abcc4de0bc62cb462e076072db934dd8c7e.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            174,
            832,
            368,
            865
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Be bold",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            165,
            864,
            248,
            871
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Boldly pursue downturn M&A opportunities if they materialize — downturns are, on average, good times to make deals",
        "bbox": [
            163,
            871,
            460,
            896
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/0ce7ba838495f813dcdbd3cf3098bfe5e9581a3c9dd21cbb33f1017df40b8f00.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            659,
            852,
            832,
            876
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Be transformative",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            632,
            880,
            818,
            887
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Use transformational deals to stay ahead of the curve and accelerate out of the recession when the upturn starts",
        "bbox": [
            630,
            888,
            914,
            912
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
